@base = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@token = paste-accessToken-here

### 상태 확인
GET {{base}}/api/health

### 분석 담당 로그인
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"analyst@hanul.example","password":"Analyst-lab-2026!"}

### 현재 사용자
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 거래처 목록
GET {{base}}/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 거래처 등록
POST {{base}}/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"name":"온유 사무용품","contactEmail":"sales@example.test","category":"OFFICE"}

### 청구서 조회
GET {{base}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 보고서 저장
POST {{base}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"name":"부서별 합계","dimension":"department"}

### 공개 공고
GET {{base}}/api/portal/rfqs

### 견적 접수
POST {{base}}/api/portal/rfqs/hanul-office-2026/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"supplierName":"온유 사무용품","contactEmail":"sales@example.test","total":180000,"preferences":{"locale":"ko-KR"}}

